# Commands run by the launchd job com.hakios.demo (see com.hakios.demo.plist).
# Wi-Fi on the Pixel 4a: what configd has in its dynamic store while somebody joins a network in Settings, at three
# moments (the radio is up about 100 s after the kernel starts). Nothing that burns the processors, as rc.jobs does.
/redwood/bin/net_test wait 330 store
/redwood/bin/net_test wait 150 store
/redwood/bin/net_test wait 150 store
